				"string" : "Redesign the {{gtClass:name=SmalltalkIntroSlideshow}} to demonstrate live programming with Smalltalk and GT. Don't waste time introducing the syntax and other basics. Just dive straight into the Ludo example. Perhaps start with the {{gtClass:name=GtLudoDie}}. \nContrast the usual textual coding approach with examples built from notebook pages."
